{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33963","headline":"开元寺佛鉢诗 · 皮日休","name":"开元寺佛鉢诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝青石作绿冰姿，曾得金人手自持。\n拘律树边斋散後，提罗花下洗来时。\n乳麋味断中天觉，麦麨香消大劫知。\n从此共君亲顶戴，斜风应不等闲吹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33963.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33963","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}